# ULX3S (Lattice ECP5) constraints — SCAFFOLD (nextpnr/Trellis .lpf format).
# Fill in real pins for the 25 MHz clock and GPDI/HDMI. Reference:
# https://github.com/emard/ulx3s/blob/master/doc/constraints/ulx3s_v20.lpf

## 25 MHz oscillator
# LOCATE COMP "clk25" SITE "G2";
# IOBUF  PORT "clk25" IO_TYPE=LVCMOS33;
# FREQUENCY PORT "clk25" 25 MHZ;

## GPDI / HDMI differential pairs go here once HdmiTx.scala exists.
